{"availability":"available","full":"85599/pinesprout","name":"pinesprout","description":"🌲 PineSprout Studio — Production-grade Pine Script v5/v6 toolkit: lint, format, v4→v6 upgrader, AI-powered code analysis & docs generator for TradingView developers.","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":8,"forks":3,"created":"2026-08-06T08:49:25Z","updated":"2026-08-13T10:10:23Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://pinesprout-khushaljain023.streamlit.app/","topics":["ai","automation","data-science","deep-learning","fintech","indian-stock-market","llm","machine-learning","nlp","nse","nse-stock-data","open-source","pinescript","python","tensorflow","tradingview"],"demo":"https://pinesprout-khushaljain023.streamlit.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T05:50:23.692Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T05:50:23.692Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T05:50:23.692Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T05:50:23.692Z","stars":8,"forks":3}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["PineSprout is a production-grade command-line toolkit for TradingView Pine Script developers. It helps you generate, format, lint, analyze, optimize, explain, upgrade, and document Pine Script indicators, strategies, and libraries — all from a single, fast CLI.","⚠️ PineSprout only ever operates on Pine Script source files you provide. It does not fetch, decompile, or bypass protection on TradingView's invite-only or protected scripts.","TradingView does not publish or maintain an official tree-sitter or ANTLR grammar for Pine Script. Rather than depend on an unofficial, potentially stale third-party grammar, PineSprout ships a small, well-tested, dependency-free lexer/parser (core/lexer.py, core/parser.py) whose output shape mirrors a tree-sitter concrete syntax tree (typed nodes, line/column spans, a children list). This keeps PineSprout robust against real-world Pine Script's many edge cases while leaving a clean seam to swap in an official grammar later, without touching the formatter, linter, analyzer, or any other…"],"features":["Every command supports --json for machine-readable output, making PineSprout easy to wire into CI pipelines, editors, and other tools."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/85599/pinesprout/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ca66a3b7d9b5370ba7c7ace23a35200d57bf71057d020df573dd2cbeacaefccd","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T05:50:23.836Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T05:50:23.836Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"PineSprout is a production-grade command-line toolkit for TradingView Pine Script developers. It helps you generate, format, lint, analyze, optimize, explain, upgrade, and document Pine Script indicators, strategies, and libraries — all from a single, fast CLI.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/85599/pinesprout/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"ca66a3b7d9b5370ba7c7ace23a35200d57bf71057d020df573dd2cbeacaefccd","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/85599/pinesprout/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T05:50:23.836Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-13T10:10:23Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/85599/pinesprout/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T05:50:23.837Z","hash":"ca66a3b7d9b5370ba7c7ace23a35200d57bf71057d020df573dd2cbeacaefccd","originalBytes":9480,"storedBytes":9480,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["pinesprout","script","docs","generate","pine","strategy","plugins","template","format","lint","screenshots","analysis","indicator","indicator.pine","new","streamlit","tradingview","analyze","bash","generator.py","heatmap","live","market","output","upgrade","builder","generation","indicators","issues","light","line","list","about","ast","check","cli","command","complexity","core","entry","every","explain","full","grammar","history","including","install","license","lintissue","markdown","nifty","optimize","page","pip","plugin","python","readme","read